{"id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","title":"Measurable Function","display":"df-measurable-function — Measurable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-measurable-function","aliases":["58-df-measurable-function","Measurable Function","Borel Function","58-df-zfc-meas-measurable-function","58-df-zfc-measure3-real-measurable-function","58-df-zfc-measure5-measurable-function","58-df-zfc-measure6-measurable-function"],"display":"df-measurable-function — Measurable Function","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-measurable-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-measurable-function</span><span>Measurable Function</span><span>Borel Function</span><span>58-df-zfc-meas-measurable-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-real-measurable-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-measurable-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-measurable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measurable-function — Measurable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal A)\">\\((X,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\mathcal B)\">\\((Y,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (measurable spaces)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (a sigma-algebra on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> used by the real-valued alias)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Y^X\">\\(f\\in Y^X\\)</span> (function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S\\)</span> (measurable-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))\\)</span> (measurable-function predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> (real-valued Borel-measurable predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurableFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurableFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableFunction}_S\\)</span> (alias predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B)) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B)) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}meas} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurableFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}meas} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurableFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure6} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure6} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A function between measurable spaces is measurable when every codomain-measurable set has a domain-measurable inverse image.</li>\n<li>For real-valued maps, measurability is equivalently characterized by measurability of all strict sublevel sets; this is a theorem derived from the Borel generators, not a second definition of the same predicate.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-meas-measurable-function</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-measure3-real-measurable-function</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-measure5-measurable-function</code>, and <code>58-df-zfc-measure6-measurable-function</code> are merged here.</li>\n<li>Simple: finite range values, measurable</li>\n<li>Approximation: simple functions approximate measurable</li>\n<li>Dominated-convergence data belong to a separate theorem context and are not part of measurable-function syntax.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Folland, Real Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S$ (measurable-space predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"(Y,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurableFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B)) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}meas} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurableFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\Sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}function\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure6} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(Y,\\mathcal B))","display":true}],"bytes":3500,"backlinks":[{"id":"7df291a6731ae8a3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S$ (real measurable-function predicate; see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])"},{"id":"f0355544d1bb59cc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f\\in{}^X[0,\\infty]$ 且\n$\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))$\n（see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]）"},{"id":"31e71a3e39e9a1b8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_+$ 为 $[0,\\infty]$ 上的 Borel $\\sigma$-代数，且 $\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))$（see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]）"},{"id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measurable}$ 取 [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"d41695b9af12c800","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"86bc7b5f63062534","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F)$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])"},{"id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measurable}$ 取 [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"263379658f1ae518","anchor":"ref-7","locati